  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 CE 09}说起来，我还不太清楚\n你们的战斗方式。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:19:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 03 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 BA 02}我的武器是短剑。\n威力不大，攻击距离也短，\n但很轻，{F2 01 03 01}行动起来快{F2 01 01 01}。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:19:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}至于人格面具，\n比较{F2 01 03 01}擅长疾风属性的技能{F2 01 01 01}吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:19:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_019",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}就算挨打，{F2 01 03 01}疾风属性\n基本也没问题{F2 01 01 01}。\n不过，电击可饶了我吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:20:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}接下来轮到小熊了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:20:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 19 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}小熊是为所有女孩带来治愈与梦想的\n可爱吉祥物熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:20:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_022",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}拿手招式是“贯穿心扉光线”\n和“心动☆爱心拳”熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:21:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_023",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 09}也就是说，实战中派不上用场。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:22:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 25 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}开、开玩笑的熊！\n不瞒你说，小熊的武器就是爪子！\n有本事的熊可要亮出爪子哦！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:22:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}虽然攻击距离短，\n但{F2 01 03 01}威力不输给老师们的武器{F2 01 01 01}熊！\n碰到可是会受伤的熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:22:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_024",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}还有人格面具……\n{F2 01 03 01}擅长冰冻属性{F2 01 01 01}熊！\n敬请期待小熊今后的成长！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_011.bf.json:23:0",
